  "description": "The Cassidy Alloy Frameset is our cure for the off-the-shelf enduro mountain bike. Build your rig, your way with a sophisticated platform to give you a rolling start. The 6061-T6 alloy frame is stiff enough to track where you point it and durable enough for truck-bed shuttle runs. Cassidy’s geometry and Split Pivot suspension design ensure a ride that mellows out steep, sketchy descents and keeps you planted on sustained, technical climbs. A RockShox Super Deluxe Select+ shock delivers 165 mm of rear travel, best paired with a 180 mm fork of your choice. Clever on-bike storage features such as a tube strap spot, a top tube mount, and full-size bottle mount keep you riding longer, or just keep the weight of a pack off your back. Whether you’re building an enduro race bike or a go-to rig for your local trails and park days, the Cassidy Alloy Frameset is a solid foundation.",
